<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets $200 mln Eurobond due 2001. [Corrected 09:40 gmt]</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets $200 mln Eurobond due 2001. [Corrected 09:40 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bear Stearns.</p>
<p>BORROWER  BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    14.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.225   PAY DATE   L13.MAY.97</p>
<p>(Corrects issue price from &quot;101.25&quot;)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.85     SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
